231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Just as first impressions are important for people, they can also be make-or-break for a home. When potential buyers walk into your house, they will start to evaluate everything they see. Their impression will ultimately determine how much they are willing to offer on a property... or even if they'll be interested in buying it at all.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
